420d13e9bccdada6144bde6bac68fb187a3c6f52
read: Terra cold reads rounds 1-9 over the seat-harness lane (each HOLD named a real hole; each cured by class, red-first, CI green). The round-9 class cure (every broker act through a held handle, bwrap &#45;-bind-fd, the pathname-access witness, writable scratch/home refusal) got no tenth Terra round, under the operator's ruling 2026-11-04 ("Settle the AI harness ... deep reads and debugging after the wiki server stands up"); live Luna read seats ran end to end through each final layout. The span merge at 420d13e9b auto-merged with no conflicts (CI 42050272611 green). The kill(-1) incident is guarded by killGroup (pgid > 1) plus its witnesses. Residuals named in the PR and in the carrier's #/owed, with the deep read owed after standing.

